<title>USA: AMEX closing averages.</title>
<headline>AMEX closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the American Stock Exchange closed higher in active trading.</p>
<p>The Amex Composite index closed at 630.10, a record, up 3.98.</p>
<p>The average price per share rose $0.09.</p>
<p>Advancers beat decliners 321 to 256.</p>
<p>Preliminary volume was 22,148,800 compared with 21,407,500 on Thursday.</p>
<p>(Prices official as of 1630 EST/2130 GMT)</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1881))</p>
